            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Prerequisites</h3>In this game, we reinforce the relationship between a number and its order. To make the most of this activity, we recommend reviewing first:</p><p><ul><li><b>Sequence game (Part II)</b>: in this game, sequences are present up to the billion order (<htcite0>).</li><li><b>Numerical families (Part II)</b>: we continue exploring our family generations and their connection to numbers (<htcite1>).</li></ul></p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "21bb2948-249d-4645-a512-26209b8e529a",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Sequence game (Part II)",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
